                <divLine xml:id="m-05aca03b-9016-4e45-ba3d-4cc71262932d" facs="#m-ef2c59fa-c1e0-4153-9576-c90a6ef72048" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-5eff2e4e-44b7-436d-a935-d0d9442698b3">
              <lg xml:id="m-d4e1cc56-7812-4c5a-8b4f-601f9f8a0141">
                <l xml:id="m-73c2a0a2-7874-42a8-9213-aea2f965749e" facs="#m-6a74ad24-4463-4e30-8dce-db365fa11637" label="text-like">Sunday at Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-9ad5f707-eee9-44f8-a3e2-aac3982634da" facs="#m-ae71615a-eee0-4fe8-98da-c407ccd0078e" label="ambiguous">260</l><l xml:id="m-b794d322-aabf-4946-ad65-467a8d265ab7" facs="#m-edfbdedf-2d40-4012-af56-ab9889c5d0ac" label="text-like">Or, according to a more recent custom.</l><l xml:id="m-91e5189b-70a6-4d4f-bcfe-fb44203e32e7" facs="#m-68504980-cdd4-4ad7-be49-c373799c0ad4" label="lyrics-like">V. Di-rigátur Dómine oráti-o mé-a.</l><l xml:id="m-a994aa88-a2ba-4b24-bf5b-44f8ffcee186" facs="#m-9440ad17-bee8-4afc-b088-73bceef2737f" label="lyrics-like">N. Sicut incénsum in conspéctu tú-o.</l><l xml:id="m-df6e0bd6-d562-4961-9a65-973772adea50" facs="#m-0cad7484-e943-4c07-b7e9-2848cd75fc7e" label="text-like">Atthe Magnificat. Antiphon is Proper.</l><l xml:id="m-4b91df7e-4e62-4b09-8e7a-1337ce3982c6" facs="#m-4ba90a48-b4a3-4824-b9d5-f60b6136169d" label="text-like">Canticle of the Blessed Virgin Mary. Luke I.</l><l xml:id="m-3f88b088-533f-4cfb-ba60-d9fbdf85376a" facs="#m-9bfdb410-d94f-49bd-828f-a0653b672d48" label="lyrics-like">Agníficat“ánima méa Dó-] dispérsit supérbos ménte córdis</l><l xml:id="m-aa9d4db0-b3b2-486c-88f6-4e83321fbb8b" facs="#m-7bd91c18-4301-403b-ba7f-ee9d2b52728d" label="ambiguous">SIt minum.</l><l xml:id="m-8a4fef12-a5e5-4601-9d7c-f0d691840e4a" facs="#m-ddf049b0-8585-42bd-9401-5b065f224ab8" label="lyrics-like">súi.</l><l xml:id="m-19a0d759-b455-4695-8432-9dd38905e4e1" facs="#m-0e27f094-01f0-477b-b570-042de3cad486" label="lyrics-like">Et exsultávit spiritus méus*in</l><l xml:id="m-4f565066-20ff-4a2b-b4ad-26f4d22ee35d" facs="#m-c05f4e4e-0f40-4118-9fc2-78100fb097c8" label="lyrics-like">Depósuit poténtes de séde, * et</l><l xml:id="m-90ac438d-4ee3-4650-b4de-1bb6b46ebc29" facs="#m-58282ade-ed34-48a0-b603-c98d84fbc65c" label="lyrics-like">exaltàvit húmiles.</l><l xml:id="m-1fa8c888-8d9b-470f-b3ce-b2539305cab5" facs="#m-b45d38cd-d8b7-488a-9b9e-23ec9a67901e" label="lyrics-like">Déo salutári méo.</l><l xml:id="m-e01c7c3a-4a04-4592-9526-3fe6cc318345" facs="#m-b09c5c2d-bafc-4cc8-b241-1c43e47b61eb" label="lyrics-like">Esuriéntes implévit bónis:</l><l xml:id="m-ce0702c9-3ae1-4f2d-9797-84620258d7ff" facs="#m-77eb7d76-20aa-4062-a2a8-ef44a6272528" label="lyrics-like">Quia respéxit humilitátem ancil¬</l><l xml:id="m-50467d96-ca8c-49e9-aeb4-c9c09b20cd19" facs="#m-62cad9c1-8116-43a5-8502-f6dd9b15b27b" label="lyrics-like">divites dimísit inánes.</l><l xml:id="m-3dd486b1-e27d-4947-b77f-67c096036803" facs="#m-489b24ab-aec5-46be-990e-6cd118446bc1" label="lyrics-like">lae súae:" ecce enim ex hoc beá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f6410e6-8a42-4efc-a680-163684a4f76d" facs="#m-598780e3-4361-4d23-b63d-876f58e67d17" label="lyrics-like">Suscépit Israel púerum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-85b278e7-2c32-4a3e-94df-caf937c29a64" facs="#m-301e6b68-74e8-447b-b22f-fa0848dfb4ec" label="lyrics-like">tam me dicent ómnes generatiónes.</l><l xml:id="m-3b65c69d-5fae-4e0e-afda-2b48af66b2c5" facs="#m-a1535927-333d-4126-a0bd-9057da5101fe" label="lyrics-like">Quia fécit mihi mágna qui pótens</l><l xml:id="m-668b11af-3b56-4663-aa78-421c09b74435" facs="#m-7876c209-4d6f-469e-b520-bd7664b9fbc6" label="lyrics-like">recordátus misericórdiae súae:</l><l xml:id="m-a1daebba-a873-4e21-8559-08c956361824" facs="#m-ead98d75-f108-489f-9af3-a1934f091748" label="lyrics-like">Sicut locútus est ad pâtres nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a0fa5a0f-ff79-42c7-a4d2-0c4b5413a7df" facs="#m-049784ac-3678-4ac3-8135-19920d457fa7" label="lyrics-like">est : * et sánctum nómen éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-f5565d24-cabd-493e-af6f-7c1422e10f44" facs="#m-5a6f1a0f-6502-4926-84f8-047712b1e719" label="lyrics-like">tos:“Abraham et sémini éjus</l><l xml:id="m-137296d4-dc7e-49ca-997c-3a08c88627e2" facs="#m-75f99ee2-104d-44cb-b156-ce5dbb607348" label="lyrics-like">Et misericórdia éjus a progénie</l><l xml:id="m-598a5654-d473-4434-8d67-b035bfcea522" facs="#m-8013ca07-10b3-48ef-96fd-f5a4158661eb" label="lyrics-like">in progénies: * timéntibus éum.</l><l xml:id="m-465daad8-f49a-4068-a5c8-29228217d993" facs="#m-59388a47-ae2c-4325-92e0-e70fef2f3b0d" label="lyrics-like">in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-8cacc3d1-8868-4baf-ac7b-46c00b2eb4c4" facs="#m-3767f652-4766-499a-89d9-6165726ded0f" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-8a91726d-16e3-45e2-8f34-9d46bb5b8b90" facs="#m-45308836-3935-416f-a0ad-e8bea75b74a4" label="lyrics-like">Fécit poténtiam in bráchio súo:"</l><l xml:id="m-36f551d5-01ab-4bf2-ab7f-dd304825658b" facs="#m-255b2c21-11ed-4a26-a82f-ee0c73c507e8" label="lyrics-like">After the Antiphon of the Magníficat. the Prayer of the Office is said. Then</l><l xml:id="m-a8e25af2-b650-45ee-ae1f-835c62d2fec5" facs="#m-07dd573e-6d1d-4286-90e4-fcfcb162324d" label="lyrics-like">follow the Commemorations, it ãny; and the Suffrage of All the Saints or the</l><l xml:id="m-482c2dc5-cdab-4593-ba5e-b74e45db4745" facs="#m-0fdf7d48-0234-4a77-bd10-3fd5c8eae0f2" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Cross, if either is to be said.</l><l xml:id="m-773b9319-2117-4af5-8926-a060c61e615e" facs="#m-51b5cb43-493e-4b72-91cd-5411b4f5ba64" label="text-like">The Suffrage of All the Saints is said on Sundays of semi-double rite,</l><l xml:id="m-b4e23bed-d466-45cd-a327-6196e58cc48e" facs="#m-669a25c1-a3c9-4791-8373-d47519dbbad9" label="text-like">excent during Advent. Passiontide, and Paschat Time. It is omitted if</l><l xml:id="m-cbdd08ee-c5ce-41a1-97a4-c5540afadf56" facs="#m-09f40d1a-b6c6-4510-9559-6492d5c669ca" label="text-like">there be a Commemoration ot a double feast or of an Octave.</l><l xml:id="m-5b723502-82b8-429d-b905-102d0a46b570" facs="#m-c7d19bb5-3415-4bad-a3f9-b1b5ea54b0f8" label="text-like">Suffrage of All the Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-7dc47a35-2a4d-471b-b327-8708f46d5c4d" facs="#m-96b9641e-6cfa-44ef-836c-a1039e10db82" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-8253029e-4270-4e09-b5e9-f14402e765e4" facs="#m-1e4f7fe6-469c-436b-9dbb-d6fd2c65e41c" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-f6ecc6dc-8d67-4a8a-9419-c8c0ee2076ad" facs="#m-b5d0efe8-790c-44de-8f36-bf2395586332" label="lyrics-like">E-a-ta Dé-i Génitrix, “Virgo Marí-a, Sanctíque</l><l xml:id="m-2ae95593-0ebf-4876-9d6c-a5ae1b0ad504" facs="#m-55258f97-e29b-4cb1-804a-ac2fff8f8038" label="lyrics-like">ómnes intercédant pro nó-bis ad Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5a3e8373-9ded-4193-818c-625ec4ca7107" facs="#m-746e557a-abc7-4416-b441-eaf715ff1e35" label="lyrics-like">v. Mirificávit Dóminus Sánctos súos.</l><l xml:id="m-5a805bc2-5bd3-49af-8ee2-c84a0063ee4a" facs="#m-c5d8d2d7-05af-4401-9515-b62fbd89e5bb" label="lyrics-like">H. Et exaudivit éos clamántes ad se.</l><l xml:id="m-b2d10df2-9d73-4af6-bab5-c8a25f4a3222" facs="#m-0a16230a-1e04-46b8-aec6-48811fe47dfb" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-f8761bc0-3363-4fff-9c37-536a95a7ba09" facs="#m-02124436-60f8-4a1c-9a08-54df14f060e5" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-5762000d-ca8e-4e75-8797-29cfab6a52e2" facs="#m-59dff38a-59b1-44a5-9c4c-ba71ceda6790" label="lyrics-like">cunctis nos, quaésumus Dómi-Genitrice María, cum beáto Joseph,</l><l xml:id="m-21ab0e3b-f8be-4dcc-b4f6-db636ca41094" facs="#m-cd7d13d9-b54b-4979-9589-366bb0bb80e3" label="lyrics-like">Il ne, mentis et córporis defénde</l><l xml:id="m-10c77ad6-8ccf-4824-8634-1cff44f08626" facs="#m-1a01265b-8fe9-4adb-a410-d94de4938073" label="lyrics-like">beátis Apóstolis tuis Petro et Paulo,</l><l xml:id="m-84c0c30e-b896-4e8d-a84b-b304a8c0a903" facs="#m-188a90bf-e1e9-4459-8b2b-dcc03868d826" label="lyrics-like">periculis:“et intercedénte beáta</l><l xml:id="m-a55c27fc-3c6d-4ed3-9a8d-67a7a145d592" facs="#m-8dadec6f-d520-40df-9dad-6e20bebabc9e" label="lyrics-like">atque beãto N. et ómnibus Sanctis,</l><l xml:id="m-915425f7-bc09-49a9-aefb-d483217555e6" facs="#m-a2a84dd7-7fb5-4d9c-973c-df62ea2b0ef5" label="lyrics-like">tgloriósa semper Virgine Dei</l><l xml:id="m-095d82e4-542d-4a6e-bc11-71f920dc18c8" facs="#m-f743b613-838e-4d6a-a9ae-b18235ad564d" label="lyrics-like">salútem nobis tribue benignus et</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>